Package: librescrs-agent-common-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Shared CMake package and wire contract for the LibreSCRS agent
 The CMake CONFIG package, the platform-neutral public headers and the wire
 description shared by the agent and by every client of it.
 .
 This package exists because the CMake config and its version file are
 installed from every configuration, so one package has to own them. Making
 either component package own them would drag Qt into the agent's dependency
 closure or the middleware into every Qt client's; a third, dependency-free
 package holding what both need is the smallest split that avoids both.

Package: librescrs-agent-core-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, librescrs-agent-common-dev (= ${source:Version}), liblibrescrs-dev (>= 5.0)
Description: LibreSCRS agent core, wire codec and PKCS#11 facade (static)
 The platform-neutral agent brain and everything a host links against it: the
 wire codec, the PKCS#11 facade and its socket backend, and the test-support
 archive.
 .
 These are static archives with no shared counterpart, so this package has no
 runtime sibling and a host depends on it only to build. That asymmetry is
 correct and should not be tidied away. For the same reason the archives are
 not moved into a -static package as the RPM guideline would otherwise
 suggest: doing so would leave an empty development package behind.

Package: liblibrescrs-agentclient-qt5
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Qt client library for the LibreSCRS smart-card agent
 The library desktop front-ends link against to talk to the agent over its
 session-bus interface.

Package: liblibrescrs-agentclient-qt-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         liblibrescrs-agentclient-qt5 (= ${binary:Version}),
         librescrs-agent-common-dev (= ${source:Version}),
         librescrs-agent-core-dev (= ${source:Version}),
         qt6-base-dev
Description: Development files for the LibreSCRS agent Qt client library
 Headers, linker symlink and the CMake component targets for building against
 the Qt client library.
